- This package does not modify existing application bootstrap or wire every Slice-1 route automatically. It provides a reusable auth module family and verifies the required behavior on representative endpoints.
- The write/audit sinks are integration seams, not persistence implementations.
- IdP cryptographic verification remains an integration concern outside this REQ package.
